``NXmx``: the fixed unit-conversion targets on the read path are now resolved once at
import rather than on every conversion. A ``pint`` unit named by a string is re-parsed at
each ``.to()`` call, and a prefixed name such as ``mm`` goes through the unit-prefix search
rather than a dictionary lookup; a 256-module detector paid that four times per module.
Models built from a file are unchanged.
